    {
      "id": "s0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] object: [[p1]] for tagging is created from the Amazon Resource Name (ARN) for the object. Specifically, [[p2]] is created from the strings that come after the word [[p3]] in the ARN. For example, an OpsMetadata object with an ARN of [[p4]] has a [[p5]] of either [[p6]] or [[p7]] .",
